msgstr "Pliki pobierania produktów"

#. translators: Tooltip of the "Products Download Files" section heading. The line break and spacing are only how the text is laid out in the file; translate it as one sentence.
#: inc/template-classes/class-wcml-settings-ui.php:78
msgid ""
"If you are using downloadable products, you can choose to have their paths\n"
"                                            synchronized, or seperate for each language."
msgstr "Jeśli korzystasz z produktów do pobrania, możesz wybrać, czy ich ścieżki\n                                            mają być synchronizowane, czy oddzielne dla każdego języka."

#. translators: Label of the option that gives each translated product its own download files, in the plugin's settings.
#: inc/template-classes/class-wcml-settings-ui.php:87
msgid "Add separate download files for translations when translating products"
msgstr "Dodaj oddzielne pliki pobierania dla tłumaczeń podczas tłumaczenia produktów"

#. translators: Heading of the section of the plugin's settings about how reviews are shown.
#: inc/template-classes/class-wcml-settings-ui.php:92
msgid "Product reviews"
msgstr "Opinie o produktach"

#. translators: Tooltip of the "Product reviews" section heading.
#: inc/template-classes/class-wcml-settings-ui.php:94
msgid "Define how to display product reviews on the product page by default. The customer will be still able to filter reviews by language."
msgstr "Zdefiniuj, jak domyślnie wyświetlać opinie o produktach na stronie produktu. Klient nadal będzie mógł filtrować opinie według języka."

#. translators: Label of the checkbox that shows reviews written in every language on a product page.
#: inc/template-classes/class-wcml-settings-ui.php:105
